{"name":"Cochise","hex":"#ddcdb3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Cochise","blocks":[{"text":"Cochise was the leader of the Chiricahui local group of the Chokonen and principal nantan of the Chokonen band of the Chiricahua Apache. A key war leader during the Apache Wars, he led an uprising that began in 1861 and persisted until a peace treaty was negotiated in 1872. Cochise County is named after him."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/Cochise_sculpture_%28Cie%C5%84%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cochise"},{"title":"Cochise (rapper)","blocks":[{"text":"Terrell Anthony Cox, known professionally as Cochise, is an American rapper. He initially garnered attention after his single \"Hatchback\" rose to popularity on TikTok in 2020. His 2021 single, \"Tell Em\", peaked at number 64 on the  Billboard Hot 100. Cochise has since released three studio albums, with his debut being Benbow Crescent in 2021."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Cochise_in_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Cochise_in_2023_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cochise_(rapper)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/DragoonMountains.JPG/500px-DragoonMountains.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/DragoonMountains.JPG/1280px-DragoonMountains.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/DragoonMountains.JPG/500px-DragoonMountains.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Dragoon Mountains in Southeastern Arizona, where Cochise hid with his warriors","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADragoonMountains.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/CochiseStronghold.JPG/500px-CochiseStronghold.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/CochiseStronghold.JPG/1280px-CochiseStronghold.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/CochiseStronghold.JPG/500px-CochiseStronghold.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Cochise Stronghold, Dragoon Mountains, southeastern Arizona","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACochiseStronghold.JPG"}],"sounds":{}}}